   SuperscriptBox[
    SubscriptBox["A", "\[Mu]"], "a"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "6dcb7109-7468-4f27-8e03-63a909e974eb"],
 " becomes the traditional Yang-Mills gauge field."
}], "Text",
